.SH BUGS
Requires sleep. Roughly seven hours, though this has been observed to degrade
gracefully under load.
.PP
Does not scale horizontally. Running multiple instances has not been attempted
and is not supported.
.PP
Occasionally rewrites something that already worked. This is documented
behaviour and will not be fixed.
.PP
Will read the datasheet instead of going to bed. Closed as WONTFIX.
.PP
Report anything else to the author.
